## Interface: @WOWLAB_INTERFACE@
## Title: WowLab
## Notes: Records this character's gear, talents, appearance choices, collections, currencies, professions, spellbook, action bars, key bindings, race, body type and class for the local wowlab tools. No GUIDs. No names or realms unless you turn the crew book on (/wowlab crew on), and then only on this computer.
## SavedVariables: WowLabDB, WowLabCrewDB
## SavedVariablesPerCharacter: WowLabCharDB

# Template (ADR-0026): `wowlab addon install lab` replaces the Interface
# placeholder with the discovered client's interface version; the repository
# never holds a number (L6).

Core.lua
Gear.lua
Talents.lua
Customization.lua
